---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact MathGraph — Independent Assurance" description="Contact MathGraph about scoped independent assurance audits, or use public GitHub channels for open-source reports." currentPath="/contact/">
  <header class="section section--compact"><div class="shell">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1>Discuss an independent assurance audit.</h1>
    <p class="lede">For confidential or proprietary audit enquiries, email heath@mathgraph.org before sharing sensitive material. Public GitHub issues are suitable only for non-confidential reproducible reports. Please do not send secrets or proprietary source until an appropriate agreement and secure transfer method are established.</p>
  </div></header>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell grid">
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Audit enquiries</h2><p><a href="mailto:heath@mathgraph.org?subject=MathGraph%20independent%20assurance%20enquiry">heath@mathgraph.org</a></p><p>Describe the consequential claim, system boundary and desired outcome without attaching sensitive information.</p></article>
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Repository</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph">github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph ↗</a></p><p>Inspect code, protocols, qualification tests, and immutable evidence sources.</p></article>
    <article class="span-6 callout"><h2>Issues</h2><p><a href="https://github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph/issues">github.com/metalogiclabs/mathgraph/issues ↗</a></p><p>Report a reproducible defect or propose a scoped improvement. Public issue handling does not create a trust relationship or verification result.</p></article>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
